function shell(inner){const nav=[['overview','overview','制作总览'],['content','content','内容与来源'],['gallery','gallery','整稿画廊'],['style','style','风格校准'],['runs','runs','任务与交付']];return `<div data-od-id="shell" class="shell"><aside data-od-id="sidebar" class="sidebar"><div class="logo"><span class="mark">D</span>Deck Master</div>${button('← 全部项目','nav-projects','project-open')}<div class="side-project"><span class="small-text muted">当前项目</span><strong>北岸 · 服务协同方案</strong><span class="small-text faint">24 页 · 示例项目</span></div><nav class="nav" aria-label="项目工作区">${nav.map(([r,i,l])=>`<button data-od-id="nav-${r}" data-action="nav-${r}" class="${state.route===r||(state.route==='page'&&r==='gallery')?'active':''}" ${state.route===r?'aria-current="page"':''}><span class="nav-icon" aria-hidden="true">${uiIcon(i)}</span>${l}${r==='runs'&&state.tasks.length?`<span class="nav-count">${state.tasks.length}</span>`:''}</button>`).join('')}</nav><div class="sidebar-footer">${button('连接状态 · 未连接','connection-info','text-link')}<p class="small-text faint" style="margin-top:8px">当前项目为示例 · 仅本机保存</p>${button('清除本机数据','reset','text-link','style="margin-top:12px"')}</div></aside><div class="content"><header data-od-id="topbar" class="topbar"><div class="crumb"><span>方案制作</span><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span style="color:var(--fg)">${state.route==='projects'?'全部项目':'北岸服务协同方案'}</span><span class="version">R18</span></div><div class="row"><span class="sample">本机工作区</span><span class="small-text faint">数据仅保存在本机</span></div></header><main data-od-id="workspace" id="main" class="workspace ${state.route==='page'?'page-workspace':''}">${inner}</main></div></div>`}
function head(title,desc,actions='',eyebrow=''){return `<div data-od-id="page-head" class="page-head"><div>${eyebrow?`<div class="eyebrow">${eyebrow}</div>`:''}<h1 data-od-id="view-title" id="view-title" tabindex="-1">${title}</h1><p>${desc}</p></div>${actions?`<div class="row wrap">${actions}</div>`:''}</div>`}
function projects(){return head('项目','打开正在制作的方案。材料、逐页内容、生成提示词和每版产物，都在同一个地方。',button('新建项目','new-project','primary'),'DECK MASTER / PROJECTS')+`<div class="intro-strip">从一份材料开始，或随时接着处理一份稿。<br>材料、内容和制作进度集中管理。</div><div class="toolbar"><label><span class="sr-only">搜索项目</span><input data-od-id="input-15650" placeholder="搜索项目名称" aria-label="搜索项目名称" data-input="project-search"></label><span class="small-text muted">1 个示例项目</span></div><div class="project-entry"><div class="project-preview">${slide(pages[0])}</div><div><h2>北岸 · 服务协同方案</h2><p>24 页方案 · 面向区域服务负责人 · 试点决策</p><div class="row wrap">${tag('2 页需要校准风格','warn')}${tag('20 / 24 页已有原图')}</div><small>最近停留：第 8 页 · 原图与提示词</small></div>${button('继续制作 →','nav-overview','primary')}</div>${state.projectDrafts.map((p,i)=>`<article class="draft-project"><div><h3>${esc(p.name)}</h3><p>${esc(p.brief)}</p><div class="row wrap" style="margin-top:9px">${tag('待制作','warn')}${tag(p.requestSaved?'首轮请求已保存 · 待交接':'尚未创建制作请求')}</div></div>${button('打开准备页 →','draft-open-'+i)}</article>`).join('')}<div class="footer-note">项目保存在当前浏览器，可在下次打开时继续。</div>`}
function overview(){const unresolved=[8,9].filter(i=>!state.adopted.includes(i));return head('制作总览',pages.filter(p=>hasArtifact(p,'image')).length+' 页原图可看；'+(unresolved.length?'第 '+unresolved.join('、')+' 页风格待校准。':'风格候选已采用，相关 SVG 与 PPT 待更新。'),button('看 24 页原图 →','overview-gallery','primary'),'制作总览')+`${styleResumeBanner()}<div data-od-id="action-band" class="action-band"><section class="action-main"><div class="row between"><span class="muted small-text">需要你处理</span>${tag(unresolved.length+' 页','warn')}</div><h2>${unresolved.length?'第 '+unresolved.join('、')+' 页与参考页风格不一致':'继续更新已采用页的下游产物'}</h2><p class="muted">并排看原图和实际提示词，选择要沿用的风格；目标页的内容保持不变。</p><div>${button('以第 7 页为参考，开始校准','nav-style')}</div></section><section class="action-list"><div class="action-item"><span class="action-n">01</span><div><strong>为最后 4 页安排原图生成</strong><p>第 21–24 页已有逐页稿与提示词</p></div>${button('安排缺图页','missing-image','small')}</div><div class="action-item"><span class="action-n">02</span><div><strong>确认第 19 页的提示词缺口</strong><p>第 19 页可看原图，但无法还原执行输入</p></div>${button('补齐提示词记录','page-19-prompt','small')}</div><div class="action-item"><span class="action-n">03</span><div><strong>处理交付前缺项</strong><p>还有 12 页没有 PPT 单页预览</p></div>${button('定位交付缺项','nav-runs','small')}</div></section></div><div class="section-head"><h2>逐页制作进展</h2><span class="small-text muted">点击任意格子，直接进入对应产物</span></div><div class="toolbar"><div class="segmented">${['all','todo'].map((v,i)=>button(i?'只看需要处理':'全部 24 页','matrix-'+v,state.matrixFilter===v?'active':'')).join('')}</div><label><input data-od-id="input-18022" data-input="matrix-search" value="${esc(state.search)}" placeholder="搜索页码或标题" aria-label="搜索页码或标题"></label></div><div class="matrix-wrap"><table class="matrix" role="grid" aria-label="逐页制作矩阵，方向键移动，Enter 打开产物"><thead><tr><th>页面</th><th>逐页稿</th><th>提示词</th><th>原图</th><th>SVG</th><th>PPT 预览</th></tr></thead><tbody>${matrixRows()}</tbody></table></div><div class="matrix-caption"><span>${uiIcon("check")} 可查看　<span class="accent">${uiIcon("attention")} 需要处理</span>　${uiIcon("minus")} 尚未生成</span><span>各页独立推进；不是必须逐格完成的线性审批流程。</span></div>`}
function match(p){return !state.search||(`${p.id} ${p.title}`).toLowerCase().includes(state.search.toLowerCase())}
function matrixRows(){let ch=-1;const list=pages.filter(p=>match(p)&&(state.matrixFilter==='all'||p.drift||!hasArtifact(p,'ppt')||!p.prompt));if(!list.some(p=>state.matrixFocus?.startsWith(p.id+':')))state.matrixFocus=list.length?list[0].id+':0':null;const focus=(p,col,layer,status='打开页面')=>`data-matrix="${p.id}:${col}" data-row="${p.id}" data-col="${col}" tabindex="${state.matrixFocus===p.id+':'+col?0:-1}" aria-label="第 ${p.id} 页，${esc(p.title)}，${stageName(layer)}，${status}"`;return list.map(p=>{let h='';if(ch!==p.chapter){ch=p.chapter;h=`<tr class="chapter-row"><td colspan="6">${chapters[ch]}</td></tr>`}return h+`<tr><td><button class="title-button" data-action="page-${p.id}-image" ${focus(p,0,'image')}><span class="matrix-thumbnail" aria-hidden="true">${hasArtifact(p,'image')?slide(p,'image'):'—'}</span><span class="mono faint">${String(p.id).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span>${esc(p.title)}</span></button></td>${['script','prompt','image','svg','ppt'].map((s,i)=>{let text='✓ 已就绪',c='';if(s==='prompt'&&!p.prompt){text='● 记录缺失';c='warn'}else if(!hasArtifact(p,s)){text='— 尚未生成';c='empty'}else if(outdated(p,s)){text='● 旧版 · 待更新';c='warn'}else if(s==='image'&&p.drift&&!state.adopted.includes(p.id)){text='● 风格待校准';c='warn'}else if(s==='image'&&state.adopted.includes(p.id)){text='✓ 已采用候选'}return `<td><button class="cell-btn ${c}" data-action="page-${p.id}-${s}" ${focus(p,i+1,s,text)}>${uiIconLabel(text)}</button></td>`}).join('')}</tr>`}).join('')}
function galleryColumnsEffective(){const work=$('.workspace'),width=work?work.clientWidth-parseFloat(getComputedStyle(work).paddingLeft)-parseFloat(getComputedStyle(work).paddingRight):innerWidth-(innerWidth<=1270?238:274);return state.galleryColumns>2&&(width-(state.galleryColumns-1)*20)/state.galleryColumns<280?2:state.galleryColumns}
function galleryPages(){return pages.filter(p=>match(p)&&(state.filter==='all'||(state.filter==='drift'?p.drift:!hasArtifact(p,state.galleryStage))))}
function gallery(){return head('整稿画廊','每次比较同一种产物。切换原图、SVG 或 PPT 预览，内容与页面顺序保持一致。',button('跨页风格校准','nav-style','primary'),'整稿画廊')+`<div class="toolbar"><div class="row wrap"><div class="segmented">${[['image','原图 '+pages.filter(p=>hasArtifact(p,'image')).length+'/24'],['svg','SVG '+pages.filter(p=>hasArtifact(p,'svg')).length+'/24'],['ppt','PPT 预览 '+pages.filter(p=>hasArtifact(p,'ppt')).length+'/24']].map(([v,l])=>button(l,'gallery-stage-'+v,state.galleryStage===v?'active':'')).join('')}</div><select data-od-id="select-21127" data-input="gallery-filter" aria-label="筛选页面"><option value="all" ${state.filter==='all'?'selected':''}>全部页面</option><option value="drift" ${state.filter==='drift'?'selected':''}>风格待校准</option><option value="missing" ${state.filter==='missing'?'selected':''}>缺少当前产物</option></select></div><div class="row"><input data-od-id="input-21391" data-input="gallery-search" value="${esc(state.search)}" placeholder="搜索页面" aria-label="搜索页面" style="width:170px"><div class="segmented">${button('网格','layout-grid',state.layout==='grid'?'active':'')}${button('连续','layout-continuous',state.layout==='continuous'?'active':'')}</div>${state.layout==='grid'?`<div class="segmented" aria-label="画廊列数">${[2,3,4].map(n=>button(n+' 列','gallery-columns-'+n,state.galleryColumns===n?'active':'')).join('')}</div>`:''}</div></div>${state.galleryStage==='image'&&state.filter==='missing'&&galleryPages().length?`<div class="handoff-banner"><p>${galleryPages().length} 页尚无原图；按当前筛选保存首次生成请求。</p>${button('为这 '+galleryPages().length+' 页保存生成请求','queue-missing-images','primary')}</div>`:''}<div class="legend"><span>当前显示：<strong>${{image:'原图',svg:'SVG',ppt:'PPT 预览'}[state.galleryStage]}</strong></span><span class="muted">R18 · 当前采用版本</span><span class="accent">第 8、9 页待校准风格</span></div>${state.layout==='grid'&&galleryColumnsEffective()!==state.galleryColumns?`<p class="form-hint">当前宽度不足以让每张图达到 280px，已按 2 列显示。</p>`:''}<div id="gallery-grid" class="gallery columns-${galleryColumnsEffective()} ${state.layout==='continuous'?'continuous':''}" data-effective-columns="${galleryColumnsEffective()}" style="margin-top:24px;--gallery-columns:${galleryColumnsEffective()}">${galleryTiles()}</div>`}
function galleryTiles(){let list=galleryPages();return list.length?list.map(p=>`<article class="slide-tile"><button class="slide-cover" data-action="page-${p.id}-${state.galleryStage}" aria-label="打开第 ${p.id} 页 ${esc(p.title)}">${slide(p,state.galleryStage)}</button><div class="tile-title"><strong><span class="mono">${String(p.id).padStart(2,'0')}</span>${esc(p.title)}</strong></div><div class="tile-meta">${outdated(p,state.galleryStage)?tag('旧版预览 · 待更新','warn'):p.drift&&!state.adopted.includes(p.id)?tag('风格待校准','warn'):tag(hasArtifact(p,state.galleryStage)?'当前采用':'尚无产物')}<span>${chapters[p.chapter].slice(3)}</span>${!hasArtifact(p,'image')&&state.galleryStage==='image'?button('安排本页原图','queue-image-'+p.id,'text-link'):button('看完整链路 →','page-'+p.id+'-'+state.galleryStage,'text-link','tabindex="-1"')}</div></article>`).join(''):'<div class="zero-state">没有匹配的页面。清除搜索或更换筛选条件。</div>'}
function promptParts(p,historical=false,snapshot=null){const shown=snapshot||(historical?{variant:'original'}:artifact(p,'image')),borrowed=d=>shown.variant!=='original'&&(!shown.styleDimensions||shown.styleDimensions.includes(d));let drift=p.drift&&!borrowed('color'),typeDrift=p.drift&&!borrowed('type');return [['本页内容','逐页稿 R12',p.title+'。'+p.sub+'。必须保留业务对象与责任关系。'],['版式结构','页面提示词 v2',p.layout===1?'横向四段流程。按受理、调度、现场、确认顺序排列，每段包含负责人和输出。':'左侧核心结论，右侧分层解释。保留目标页现有结构，不沿用参考页叙事内容。'],['色板','视觉模板 v3',drift?'浅蓝背景 #E2ECFF，蓝紫主色 #314FB2，亮紫强调 #6A75DC。':'冷纸白背景 #F2F1EA，深墨绿 #244A47，哑铜强调 #C99255。'],['字体与信息密度','用户调整 / R16',typeDrift?'大圆角模块，柔和几何字型，模块间距增大，减少页面信息密度。':'标题清晰克制，正文紧凑可读；细实线、低圆角、等重图表线条。']];}
function promptView(p, historical=false,snapshot=null){const shown=snapshot||(historical?{...initialArtifact(p,'image'),version:2,variant:'original'}:artifact(p,'image'));if(!p.prompt)return `<div class="panel-body"><h3>历史未记录执行提示词</h3><p class="muted" style="margin-top:10px">可以查看现有原图，但不能从画面反推当时实际发送的提示词。</p><div class="impact" style="margin-top:20px"><h3>重新生成之前</h3><p>基于现有逐页稿建立新的提示词草稿，并显式确认。旧原图继续保留。</p></div>${state.stage==='prompt'&&state.right==='edit'?'<p class="form-hint">在右侧整理新提示词草稿，再检查生成要求。</p>':button('建立新提示词草稿','create-prompt','primary','style="margin-top:16px"')}</div>`;return `<div class="panel-body"><div class="row between" style="margin-bottom:16px"><strong>实际发送的提示词</strong>${tag('执行快照 · 不可改写')}</div>${shown.promptText?`<section class="prompt-block"><div class="prompt-label"><strong>本次使用的提示词</strong></div><p>${esc(shown.promptText)}</p></section>`:''}${promptParts(p,historical,shown).map(([a,b,c])=>`<section class="prompt-block"><div class="prompt-label"><strong>${a}</strong><span>${b}</span></div><p>${esc(c)}</p></section>`).join('')}<div class="footer-note">执行记录示例 gen-${String(p.id).padStart(3,'0')}-v${shown.version} · 提示词 v${shown.version} · 同版原图关联。模板和用户修改已展开，显示的是执行时的最终文本。</div></div>`}
function stageBody(p,s,version='current'){const shown=typeof version==='object'?version:version==='historical'?{...initialArtifact(p,s),version:2,variant:'original'}:version==='candidate'?nextArtifact(p,s):artifact(p,s);const fixed=typeof version==='object'||version==='historical';if(['image','svg','ppt'].includes(s))return `<div class="artifact-surface"><div class="artifact-plane ${state.marking?'selectable':''}" ${!fixed?'id="mark-surface"':''}>${slide(p,s,false,false,shown)}${!fixed&&state.region?`<div class="region-overlay" style="left:${state.region.x*100}%;top:${state.region.y*100}%;width:${state.region.w*100}%;height:${state.region.h*100}%"></div>`:''}</div></div><div class="artifact-info"><span>${s==='image'?'实际生成原图':s==='svg'?'SVG 重建结果':'PPT 单页渲染'} · ${fixed?'固定快照 v'+shown.version:artifactLabel(p,s,shown)}</span><span class="mono">${artifactRef(shown)} · R18</span></div>`;if(s==='prompt')return promptView(p,false,shown);if(s==='source')return `<div class="panel-body"><h3>本页依据</h3><div class="source-row"><div><strong>服务调研纪要（示例）</strong><p>§ 3.2 · 工单跨团队协作 · 直接引用</p></div>${tag('来源')}</div><div class="source-row"><div><strong>方案内容大纲</strong><p>第 ${p.chapter+1} 章 · ${chapters[p.chapter].slice(3)}</p></div>${tag('上游')}</div><p class="muted" style="margin-top:20px">摘录：“现场处理与运营调度之间，需要共享当前责任人、处理进度与下一步约束。”</p><div class="footer-note">示例材料，仅用于查看内容与来源的关联。</div></div>`;return `<article class="full-article"><div class="small-text" style="color:#6C8179">逐页稿 · v4 · 已采用</div><h3>${esc(p.title)}</h3><p>${esc(p.sub)}</p><ul>${p.body.map(x=>`<li>${x}：围绕同一条服务事实，明确责任、输入和完成条件。</li>`).join('')}</ul><p>本页要让听众理解：服务协同的核心是让每一位参与者知道当前发生了什么，以及下一步由谁来做。</p></article>`}
function notePanel(p){let key=noteKey();return `<div class="panel-body annotation-form"><h3>标注与意见</h3><div class="segmented" aria-label="画面操作模式">${button('阅读模式','mark-read',!state.marking?'active':'')}${button('框选模式（可选）','mark-toggle',state.marking?'active':'',!['image','svg','ppt'].includes(state.stage)?'disabled':'')}</div><p class="form-hint">${state.marking?'拖动框选画面；按 Esc 取消框选，返回阅读。':'阅读不会产生标注。无需框选，也可以针对整页写意见。'}</p>${['image','svg','ppt'].includes(state.stage)?`<details class="region-controls" ${state.region?'open':''}><summary>用百分比设置选区（键盘）</summary><div class="region-fields">${[['x','X 起点'],['y','Y 起点'],['w','宽度'],['h','高度']].map(([key,label])=>`<label>${label} %<input data-od-id="input-27896" id="region-${key}" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="${Math.round((state.region?.[key]??({x:0,y:0,w:1,h:1}[key]))*100)}" aria-label="选区${label}百分比"></label>`).join('')}</div>${button('应用百分比选区','apply-region')}</details>`:''}${state.region?`<div class="row between">${tag('已绑定当前产物选区')}${button('清除选区','clear-region','quiet')}</div>`:''}<div><label class="label" for="note-purpose">调整目的</label><select data-od-id="select-28409" id="note-purpose" style="width:100%"><option>描述需要调整的问题</option><option>修改本页内容</option><option>保持内容，调整视觉风格</option><option>修正 SVG 重建差异</option></select></div><div><label class="label" for="page-note">修改意见</label><textarea data-od-id="textarea-28686" id="page-note" data-input="page-note" placeholder="例如：沿用第 7 页的颜色和线条，保留本页的三层结构。">${esc(state.notes[key]||'')}</textarea><div class="form-hint">本机草稿 · 第 ${p.id} 页 · ${stages.find(x=>x[0]===state.stage)[1]} · v${artifact(p,state.stage).version} · R18${state.region?' · 已绑定选区':' · 整页意见'}</div></div><div class="form-bottom"><div class="row wrap">${button('保存意见','save-note')}${button('创建修改任务','submit-note','primary')}</div><p class="form-hint" id="note-save-status">${state.noteSaved[key]?'意见已保存；尚未成为执行请求。':'保存意见只留在本页；创建修改任务才创建待交接请求。'}</p></div></div>`}
function editPrompt(p){let text=state.promptDrafts[p.id]||promptParts(p).map(x=>`【${x[0]}】${x[2]}`).join('\n\n');return `<div class="panel-body"><h3>编辑下一次使用的提示词</h3><p class="form-hint" style="margin-bottom:12px">执行快照保留不变，编辑保存为独立草稿。</p><label class="label" for="prompt-draft">提示词草稿 · 第 ${p.id} 页</label><textarea data-od-id="textarea-29546" id="prompt-draft" data-input="prompt-draft" style="min-height:340px">${esc(text)}</textarea><div class="row wrap" style="margin-top:14px">${button('保存草稿','save-prompt')}${button(hasArtifact(p,'image')?'检查影响并重新生成原图':'检查要求并首次生成原图','regen-image','primary')}</div><p class="form-hint">保存后可继续编辑；创建生成请求后，再交给制作工具执行。</p></div>`}
function pageView(){if(state.stage==='prompt'&&state.right==='prompt')state.right='edit';const p=pages[state.page-1],basis=state.compare?ensureCompareBasis():null;return head(`${String(p.id).padStart(2,'0')}　${p.title}`,'同一页，从内容依据到最终文件。每个产物都保留它来自哪一版输入。',button('← 上一页','prev-page','quiet',p.id===1?'disabled':'')+button('下一页 →','next-page','quiet',p.id===24?'disabled':''),'单页工作台 / '+chapters[p.chapter])+`<nav class="chain" aria-label="本页生成链路">${stages.map(([s,l],i)=>`<button data-action="stage-${s}" class="${state.stage===s?'active':''}" ${state.stage===s?'aria-current="step"':''}><span class="chain-number">0${i+1}</span>${l}<span class="chain-state">${s==='prompt'&&!p.prompt?'记录缺失':outdated(p,s)?'旧版 · 待更新':hasArtifact(p,s)?'可查看':'尚未生成'}</span></button>`).join('')}</nav><div class="toolbar"><div class="row">${tag('当前采用 · R18')}<span class="small-text muted">版本不会随新结果自动替换</span></div><div class="row">${button(state.compare?'退出双层比较':'固定双层比较','toggle-compare')}${!hasArtifact(p,'image')?button('安排本页原图','queue-image-'+p.id,'primary'):button('仅重建 SVG','rebuild-svg')}</div></div>${state.compare?`<div class="comparison"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><strong>固定左侧：${stageName(state.stage)} / v${basis.layers[state.stage].version}</strong>${tag('R18')}</div>${stageBody(p,state.stage,basis.layers[state.stage])}</section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><label>右侧对照 <select data-od-id="select-31231" data-input="compare-layer">${stages.map(([s,l])=>`<option value="${s}" ${s===state.compareLayer?'selected':''}>${l} · R18</option>`).join('')}</select></label></div>${stageBody(p,state.compareLayer,basis.layers[state.compareLayer])}</section></div><div class="footer-note">双侧均固定于 R18，不跟随后台变化。历史页、原图与重建结果分别保留原始身份。</div>`:`<div class="page-split"><section class="viewpane"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><strong>${stages.find(x=>x[0]===state.stage)[1]}</strong><span class="small-text muted">当前版本 · v${artifact(p,state.stage).version}</span></div>${stageBody(p,state.stage)}</div>${p.drift&&artifact(p,'image').variant==='original'?`<div class="impact" style="margin-top:16px"><h3>本页风格与参考页不一致</h3><p>色板和模块形状发生变化；可以并排看提示词，选择要同步的维度。</p>${button('去风格校准 →','nav-style','text-link','style="margin-top:8px"')}</div>`:''}</section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div class="segmented">${[['prompt','执行提示词'],['note','标注与意见'],['edit','提示词草稿']].filter(([v])=>state.stage!=='prompt'||v!=='prompt').map(([v,l])=>button(l,'right-'+v,state.right===v?'active':'')).join('')}</div></div>${state.right==='prompt'?promptView(p):state.right==='note'?notePanel(p):editPrompt(p)}</section></div>`}<div class="footer-note">键盘：← / → 切换页面（输入时不触发）。框选属于当前产物，切换层级后不会自动迁移。</div>`}
function showNewProject(){rememberDialogTrigger();const d=$('#modal');d.innerHTML=`<form id="new-project-form" class="modal-body" novalidate><h2 id="dialog-title">新建项目</h2><p>填写项目目标和材料说明，保存后继续准备内容。</p><div class="new-project-form"><div><label class="label" for="project-name">项目名称 <span class="accent">*</span></label><input data-od-id="input-32755" id="project-name" maxlength="80" placeholder="例如：北岸区域服务试点方案" aria-describedby="project-name-error"><p class="field-error" id="project-name-error" role="alert"></p></div><div><label class="label" for="project-brief">这份方案要促成什么决定？ <span class="accent">*</span></label><textarea data-od-id="textarea-33230" id="project-brief" rows="2" placeholder="说明面向谁、讨论什么、希望对方决定什么。"></textarea><p class="field-error" id="project-brief-error" role="alert"></p></div><div><label class="label" for="project-materials">材料说明（可稍后补充）</label><textarea data-od-id="textarea-33454" id="project-materials" rows="2" placeholder="已有材料的名称、用途，以及哪些信息还需要补充。"></textarea><p class="form-hint">这里只保存材料说明。可稍后补充文件。</p></div><div><label class="label" for="project-location">保存位置</label><input data-od-id="input-33476" id="project-location" value="当前浏览器" readonly><p class="form-hint">数据仅保存在当前浏览器，尚未同步到其他设备。</p></div></div><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" data-action="cancel-new-project" class="quiet">取消</button><button type="submit" class="primary">创建项目</button></div></form>`;d.setAttribute('aria-labelledby','dialog-title');d.showModal();$('#project-name').focus()}
function saveNewProject(){const name=$('#project-name').value.trim(),brief=$('#project-brief').value.trim();$('#project-name-error').textContent=name?'':'请填写项目名称。';$('#project-brief-error').textContent=brief?'':'请说明这份方案要促成什么决定。';if(!name||!brief){$(!name?'#project-name':'#project-brief').focus();return}state.projectDrafts.unshift({name,brief,materials:$('#project-materials').value.trim(),location:$('#project-location').value,requestSaved:false});persist();$('#modal').close();navigate('projects');showDraftProject(0);toast('项目已创建，可以准备内容。')}
function showDraftProject(index){const p=state.projectDrafts[index];if(!p)return;modal(esc(p.name)+' · 制作前准备',`<div class="frame-banner">待制作 · 尚无稿件</div><h3>这份方案的目标</h3><p>${esc(p.brief)}</p><h3>材料说明</h3><p>${esc(p.materials||'暂未提供。可先整理任务要求，再补充材料。')}</p><div class="source-row"><span>保存位置</span><strong>${esc(p.location)}</strong></div><div class="impact" style="margin-top:16px"><h3>${p.requestSaved?'首轮制作请求已保存，待提交':'下一步：提交制作要求'}</h3><p>${p.requestSaved?'复制文本并发送后，等待真实接手。这里不会开始生成。':'先整理材料与大纲，再开始逐页制作。'}</p></div>`,button(p.requestSaved?'复制首轮交接文本':'保存制作请求',(p.requestSaved?'draft-copy-':'draft-request-')+index,'primary'))}
function currentStyleTask(){return state.tasks.find(t=>t.id===state.styleRequestId)||state.tasks.find(t=>t.kind==='风格试做')}
function styleResumeBanner(){const t=currentStyleTask();if(!t||t.status==='kept')return '';const label={returned:'候选已返回，等你比较',running:'处理中（示例记录）',adopted:'候选已采用，下游待更新',failed:'试做失败，当前原图保留',cancelled:'试做已取消，当前原图保留',queued:'试做请求已保存，待提交',copied:'已复制，尚未开始'}[t.status];return `<div class="handoff-banner"><div><strong>第 ${t.pages.join('、')} 页${label}</strong><p>${['queued','copied'].includes(t.status)?'复制文本并在 Codex 中发送；离开工作台不会丢失这个请求。':['failed','cancelled'].includes(t.status)?'可以查看原请求，调整要求后保存一条新请求。':'该请求和它的结果固定关联，可随时回来继续。'}</p></div>${button(t.status==='returned'?'比较候选 →':'继续处理 →','resume-style')}</div>`}
function fineSettings(){return `<details class="fine-settings"><summary>精细设置 <span class="muted">风格维度 · 参数 · 提示词差异</span></summary><div class="fine-body"><div class="dimension-grid">${[['color','色板','背景、主色与强调色'],['type','字体','字型方向与层级'],['density','信息密度','空间与排布节奏'],['lines','图表线条','描边、连接线与圆角']].map(([v,l,d])=>`<label class="checkline"><input data-od-id="input-36163" type="checkbox" data-dimension="${v}" ${state.dimensions.includes(v)?'checked':''}><span>${l}<small>${d}</small></span></label>`).join('')}</div><p class="form-hint">已固定：第 7 页原图 v2 作为风格参考；目标为第 8、9 页。采样参数按项目约定，不在默认流程中要求填写。</p><details class="prompt-diff"><summary>查看候选提示词差异</summary><div class="diffline keep">＝ 保留目标页的事实、出处、职责和叙事结构。</div>${[['color','浅蓝背景，蓝紫主色，亮紫强调。','冷纸白、深墨绿、哑铜强调。'],['type','柔和几何字型。','克制无衬线，标题与正文层级明确。'],['density','放大模块间距，减少页面信息。','紧凑可读，保留全部目标页信息。'],['lines','大圆角模块与粗线条。','细实线、低圆角，等重图表线条。']].filter(x=>state.dimensions.includes(x[0])).map(x=>`<div class="diffline remove">${uiIcon("minus")} ${x[1]}</div><div class="diffline add">${uiIcon("plus")} ${x[2]}</div>`).join('')}</details></div></details>`}
function styleView(){
 const t=currentStyleTask(),active=state.styleStep===3&&t,retry=state.tasks.find(x=>x.id===state.styleRetryOf),pageId=active?t.pages[0]:retry?retry.pages[0]:8,target=pages[pageId-1],ref=pages[6],status=active?t.status:'idle',adopted=status==='adopted',hasCandidate=active&&!!t.candidates,base=active?t.bases[pageId]:artifact(target,'image'),reference=active?t.style.reference:retry?.style.reference||artifact(ref,'image'),rest=state.tasks.find(x=>x.style&&x.pages.length===1&&x.pages[0]===9);
 const explain={queued:'复制制作要求，在 Codex 会话中粘贴并发送。复制后仍需等待真实接手。',copied:'已复制，尚未开始。请在 Codex 中发送这条固定请求。',running:'等候候选返回。离开工作台后，可以从总览待办继续。',returned:'轮到你比较左侧两个版本。采用、保留当前或调整要求再试都由你决定。',adopted:`第 ${pageId} 页原图已采用；完整文件仍需重建和检查。`,failed:'本次试做失败，没有候选结果。当前原图保留；可以调整要求后新建试作。',cancelled:'本次请求已取消，没有可采用的结果。当前原图保留；可以回到要求重新计划。',kept:'本次决定已保存：保留当前原图。候选记录仍可回看；需要时可调整要求重新试作。'};
 const outcome={queued:'请求已经保存，当前原图没有改变',copied:'制作要求已复制，尚未开始',running:'处理中（示例记录），当前原图保留',returned:'保留了本页内容，风格也符合预期吗？',adopted:`第 ${pageId} 页原图已更新，SVG 与 PPT 需要继续制作`,failed:'试做失败，当前原图保留',cancelled:'本次试做已取消，当前原图保留',kept:'已保留当前原图，本轮比较结束'};
 return head('沿用这一页的好风格','选定参考，说明想改什么。先试第 8 页，满意后再处理第 9 页。',button('回整稿看效果','nav-gallery'),'风格校准')+`<div class="flow-steps"><span class="${!active?'active':''}"><b>1</b>参考与要求</span><i></i><span class="${active&&['queued','copied','running'].includes(status)?'active':''}"><b>2</b>先试一页</span><i></i><span class="${active&&hasCandidate?'active':''}"><b>3</b>比较后采用</span></div><div class="style-layout ${active?'comparison-active':''}"><div class="style-main">${!active?`<div class="comparison"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><strong>参考图 · 第 7 页</strong>${tag('只借鉴风格','ok')}</div><div class="artifact-surface"><button class="reference-zoom" data-action="enlarge-reference" aria-label="放大第 7 页固定参考原图">${slide(ref,'image',false,false,reference)}</button></div><div class="artifact-info">原图 v${reference.version} · 风格参考固定</div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><strong>先试 · 第 ${pageId} 页</strong>${tag('当前采用')}</div><div class="artifact-surface">${slide(target,'image',false,false,base)}</div><div class="artifact-info">原图 v${base.version} · 本次只处理这一页</div></section></div><div class="panel requirement-panel"><label class="label" for="style-requirement">一句话说清你想怎么改</label><textarea data-od-id="textarea-39430" id="style-requirement" data-input="style-requirement" rows="2">${esc(state.styleRequirement)}</textarea><div class="row wrap" style="margin-top:12px">${tag('保留目标页事实')}${tag('保留内容与结构')}${tag('计划目标：第 8、9 页')}</div>${retry?`<p class="form-hint">新试作基于请求 TASK-${retry.id}；旧要求、状态和候选不会覆盖。</p>`:''}</div>${fineSettings()}`:`<section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><strong>第 ${pageId} 页 · ${adopted?'已采用这个候选':'固定版本比较'}</strong>${tag('请求 TASK-'+t.id)}</div><div class="comparison candidate-compare"><section><div class="compare-column-head"><strong>当前采用（请求基准）</strong><span>原图 v${base.version} · ${artifactRef(base)}</span></div><div class="artifact-surface"><button class="reference-zoom" data-action="enlarge-style-base" aria-label="放大当前请求基准原图">${slide(target,'image',false,false,base)}</button></div><div class="artifact-info">固定请求基准 · ${adopted?'现行原图已更新为 v'+artifact(target,'image').version:'比较期间保持不变'}</div></section><section><div class="compare-column-head"><strong>候选</strong><span>${hasCandidate?'原图 v'+t.candidates[pageId].version+' · '+artifactRef(t.candidates[pageId]):'尚未返回'} · TASK-${t.id}</span></div><div class="artifact-surface">${hasCandidate?`<button class="reference-zoom" data-action="enlarge-style-candidate" aria-label="放大本次候选原图">${slide(target,'image',false,false,t.candidates[pageId])}</button>`:`<div class="empty-artifact"><span class="empty-symbol">${uiIcon("clock")}</span><strong>${status==='failed'?'试做失败，尚无候选':status==='cancelled'?'请求已取消，尚无候选':'尚无候选结果'}</strong><span>当前原图与本次基准均保留</span></div>`}</div><div class="artifact-info">${adopted?'已采用 · 待后续制作检查':hasCandidate?status==='kept'?'未采用 · 已决定保留当前稿':'未采用 · 当前稿仍保留':'只接受当前请求的候选'}</div></section></div><div class="panel-body"><h3>${outcome[status]}</h3><p class="form-hint">${adopted?`采用不代表质量已通过。${pageId===8&&!rest?'第 9 页还没有执行。':'其余请求保持各自状态。'}`:explain[status]}</p><div class="row wrap" style="margin-top:16px">${status==='returned'?button('采用这个候选 · 仅第 '+pageId+' 页','adopt-style','primary')+button('保留当前','keep-style'):''}${['returned','kept','failed','cancelled','adopted'].includes(status)?button('调整要求再试','retry-style'):''}</div></div></section><details class="fine-settings reference-detail"><summary>辅助参考：查看第 7 页与本次要求</summary><div class="fine-body reference-small"><button class="reference-zoom" data-action="enlarge-reference" aria-label="放大第 7 页固定参考原图">${slide(ref,'image',false,false,reference)}</button><div><p>固定参考：${artifactRef(reference)} · 本次范围：第 ${pageId} 页 · 目标层：原图</p><p>借用维度：${t.style.dimensions.map(d=>dimensionNames[d]).join('、')}</p><p>要求：${esc(t.style.requirement)}</p><p>必须保留：${t.style.preserve.join('、')}</p></div></div></details>${['queued','copied','running'].includes(status)?`<div class="run-actions">${button('取消任务','style-cancel','quiet')}</div>`:''}${adopted&&pageId===8?`<div class="impact" style="margin-top:18px"><h3>${rest?'第 9 页已有固定请求':'再把确认过的风格用于第 9 页'}</h3><p>${rest?'当前状态：'+statusText(rest)+'。沿用已保存请求；若需要新试作，在该请求中明确选择。':'只安排余下这一页，每页候选仍分别比较和采用。'}</p>${button(rest?'查看第 9 页请求':'将余下 1 页加入待交接','batch-rest','primary','style="margin-top:12px"')}</div>`:''}`}</div><aside class="panel style-settings"><div class="panel-head"><h3>${active?'这条试做请求':'本次会发生什么'}</h3>${active?tag('已保存','ok'):''}</div><div class="panel-body">${!active?`<div class="source-row"><span>风格参考</span><strong>第 7 页原图 v${reference.version}</strong></div><div class="source-row"><span>先试范围</span><strong>第 ${pageId} 页 · 原图</strong></div><div class="source-row"><span>完整计划</span><strong>第 8、9 页</strong></div><p class="muted" style="margin:16px 0">目标页事实与结构保留。新图先作为候选，不会覆盖现稿。</p><div class="impact"><h3>采用之后</h3><p>本页 SVG、PPT 才会变为待更新；其他页面保持不变。</p></div>${button(retry?'保存第 '+pageId+' 页的新请求 →':'先试第 8 页 →','style-queue','primary','style="width:100%;margin-top:20px"')}<p class="form-hint">先保存请求，下一步由你交接给 Codex。</p>`:`<dl class="request-facts"><div><dt>请求</dt><dd class="mono">TASK-${t.id}</dd></div><div><dt>目标</dt><dd>第 ${pageId} 页 · 原图</dd></div><div><dt>基准</dt><dd>${t.baseRevision} · 原图 v${base.version}</dd></div><div><dt>参考</dt><dd>第 7 页原图 v${reference.version}</dd></div><div><dt>维度</dt><dd>${t.style.dimensions.map(d=>dimensionNames[d]).join('、')}</dd></div><div><dt>状态</dt><dd>${statusText(t)}</dd></div></dl><p class="muted" style="margin-top:16px">${explain[status]}</p>${['queued','copied'].includes(status)?button(status==='copied'?'再次复制制作要求':'复制制作要求','copy-style','primary','style="width:100%;margin-top:20px"'):''}${button('查看运行记录','nav-runs','quiet','style="width:100%;margin-top:10px"')}<div class="footer-note">请求已保存，可从制作总览继续处理。</div>`}</div></aside></div>`
}
function contentView(){return head('内容与来源','先组织方案要讲的内容，再看每一页如何展开。材料更新与生成采用分别记录。',button('添加材料或调整要求','add-material','primary'),'内容与来源')+`<div class="content-layout"><section><div class="section-head"><h2>方案大纲</h2>${tag('内容基准 R12')}</div><div class="panel" style="padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:20px"><div class="label">这份方案要促成什么决定？</div><p>面向区域服务负责人，明确服务协同试点的业务范围、执行方式与验收标准。</p><div class="row wrap" style="margin-top:14px">${tag('听众：区域服务负责人')}${tag('场景：试点决策')}${tag('24 页')}</div></div>${chapters.map((c,i)=>`<div class="outline-block"><span class="mono">0${i+1}</span><div><h3>${c.slice(3)}</h3><p>${['先理解服务流程中的断点，再确定本次方案范围。','连接现场、运营与服务网络，明确各个工作对象。','从问题受理，到处理结束与知识复用。','明确衡量口径、数据边界与系统连接方式。','决定试点范围、责任分工与风险应对。','用可回放的依据完成验收，并启动下一步。'][i]}</p><p class="small-text" style="margin-top:7px">第 ${i*4+1}–${i*4+4} 页 · ${i<2?'调研纪要 §'+(i+1):'方案整合草案'} → 逐页稿</p></div>${button('看逐页稿','page-'+(i*4+1)+'-script','small')}</div>`).join('')}</section><aside class="panel" style="align-self:start"><div class="panel-head"><h3>使用中的材料</h3>${tag('3 份')}</div><div class="panel-body">${[['服务调研纪要（示例）','已读取 · 关联第 1–9 页'],['业务流程说明（示例）','已读取 · 关联第 10–18 页'],['试点范围补充（示例）','已上传 · 尚未判断影响']].map(([a,b],i)=>`<div class="source-card"><strong>${a}</strong><p>${b}</p>${i===2?button('请求判断影响','material-impact','text-link','style="margin-top:8px"'):button('查看关联页面','source-pages-'+i,'text-link','style="margin-top:8px"')}</div>`).join('')}<div class="footer-note">更新材料后，先确认受影响的页面，再比较修改结果。</div></div></aside></div>`}
